What have you been daydreaming about lately {rank}? Your mission was La Rochelle, not Saint-Tropez. The enemy is in the east now, not on the Riviera!{pause}

We'd better stick together for what is coming.{pause}

{arialbld}Kolmar{arial} is the key corridor to the bridges across the Zar. If the Tektons lose Kolmar they lose all of Fromance.{pause}

Otton had all the time he needed for fortifying the Kolmar pass. He'll defend this sector toe to toe.{pause}


If you want my opinion {name}:{pause} that would turn into all-out trench warfare. So if I were you, from {arialbld}Saverne{arial} I'd try a landing accross the Sea of Konstance, you could take Kolmar from its rear as the city is much less defended on the south-east.{pause}{pause}


A last word of advice:{pause}











